==Icelandic==

===Alternative forms===
* [[hvað segirðu]]

===Etymology===
From {{m|is|hvað||what}} + {{m|is|segir||you say}} the second person form of the verb {{m|is|segja||to say}} + {{m|is|þú||you}}. Literally meaning "what say you?".

===Phrase===
'''[[hvað]] [[segja#Icelandic|segir]] [[þú#Icelandic|þú]]?'''

# [[how are you]]?
#: '''''Hvað segir þú'''? - [[Allt gott]], [[takk fyrir]].''
#:: '''How are you?''' - I'm fine, thanks.
#: '''''Hvað segir þú''' gott?''
#:: '''How are you'''?

